Align expo 57 web style types with React Native 0.86 so ViewStyle and TextStyle stay assignable.
- ViewStyle userSelect and TextStyle transitionDuration, from https://github.com/expo/expo/pull/51805
- Drop TextStyle boxShadow/filter/outlineColor (from https://github.com/expo/expo/pull/50610) and TextStyle cursor (Ledger-only: RN 0.86 declares it)
- Skip the ViewStyle cursor of #51805: RN 0.86 already declares it (that line targets RN 0.88 types)
Upstream issue: https://github.com/expo/expo/issues/51747 (SDK 58 fixes userSelect/transitionDuration/boxShadow/filter/outlineColor, not cursor)
Remove when expo stops redeclaring ViewStyle/TextStyle cursor (https://github.com/expo/expo/pull/52703 was closed unmerged) and mobile typecheck passes without this patch.

